      "message": "Reference Model: RRID translation takes effect when IOPMP is enabled\n\nThe specification states that this new RRID represents that the\ntransaction has been checked by a specific IOPMP. This implies that RRID\ntranslation only takes effect when IOPMP checker is enabled.",
